{
  "summary": "The experiment tested an RNA-only model using PCA_n2000 encoder without image data or fusion, establishing a baseline for RNA-only approaches. Validation accuracy of 0.485 and F1 of 0.464 suggest moderate performance, but no direct comparison to other modalities exists. The viability of RNA-only models and the potential impact of multimodal integration remain uncertain without further comparative experiments."
}

